---
// About Section Component
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 bg-warm-cream">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-forest-dark mb-4">
        About Our Agricultural Solutions
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-forest-dark/80 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        We are passionate about delivering innovative farming solutions that drive real results for agricultural businesses.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-forest-dark mb-6">
          Our Mission
        </h3>
        <p class="text-forest-dark/80 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          To empower farmers with cutting-edge agricultural technology solutions that streamline farming operations, 
          enhance crop productivity, and drive sustainable growth in today's agricultural landscape.
        </p>
        <p class="text-forest-dark/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          With years of experience and a team of dedicated agricultural professionals, we've helped hundreds 
          of farms transform their operations and achieve their farming goals.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="text-center bg-sage-light/50 rounded-natural p-4">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-fresh-green mb-2">500+</div>
            <div class="text-forest-dark/80">Farms Served</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center bg-sage-light/50 rounded-natural p-4">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-fresh-green mb-2">98%</div>
            <div class="text-forest-dark/80">Farmer Satisfaction</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-sage-light/30 rounded-natural p-8 shadow-natural">
        <div class="aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9">
          <div class="bg-sage-light rounded-natural flex items-center justify-center h-64">
            <span class="text-forest-dark/60">Agricultural Image Here</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
